label Lightswitch
Sienna flips the switch on and off.
Sienna (First Person): This is so buns…
Sienna: I don’t want to stay in this dark.
jump to_explore
[end_timeline]
label Door
Sienna opens the door to get a good look outside,
Only for the wind to shut the door closed, almost catching Sienna’s fingers in the gap.
Sienna (First Person): Okay, that’s dangerous.
Sienna: I don’t think going outside might be wise right now.
Sienna: I’ll be safer inside,
Sienna: I think.
jump to_explore
[end_timeline]
label Phone
Sienna (First Person): I got distracted with organizing my things that I didn’t get to charge my phone earlier.
Sienna: Let’s try not to use this as a flashlight then.
Sienna: I need to call Ma and Pa. They could be in danger.
Sienna: And…
Sienna: I don’t think going outside might be wise right now.
Sienna: I’ll be safer inside,
Sienna: I think.
jump to_explore
[end_timeline]
label to_explore
set {intro2_interacted} += 1.0
if {intro2_interacted} == 3.0:
	do RoomManager.change_room("hallway")
	Explore other areas of the house.
	do AudioManager.play_bgm("warp_liminal")
	do AudioManager.play_ambient("rain")